            <ArticleTitle>[Lumbar puncture with a fine needle].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>201-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>26-Gauge fine needle for lumbar puncture allows lower rate and intensity of post lumbar puncture syndrome. This technique drammatically decreases discomfort in patients who undergo myelography and helps in keeping this imaging modality indicated when necessary.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
